publiek-handoff/
docs/infra-beheer-handoff/
docs/infra-beheer-handoff-v2/
docs/herkomst-handoff/
docs/regelsimulatie-handoff/

# Testing docs staging copy. The canonical page is the doc site --
# https://iou-architectuur.open-regels.nl/ronl-business-api/developer/testing/overview/
# -- and every reference in this repo points there. This file is a working
# copy patched here and then carried over by /iou-documentation-patch; keeping
# it untracked stops it drifting into a second source of truth, which is the
# problem deleting docs/TEST*.md set out to solve.
docs/overview.md
